<meta name='title' content="3G9Y zinc site: ZRANB2 second finger on AGGUAA RNA"/>
<meta name='description' content="X-ray 1.40 A. Model 1 as deposited. One unit is one angstrom. A bond to zinc glows only while it measures under 2.5 angstrom. Materials, lights, radii and the cage faces are look, not data."/>
